From 026590d42462f8a031355aaaad34e7ea2528a6a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrLGamer <mrlgam3r@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 01:52:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] protonfixes: add XXMI model importer downloader

The importer package and the shared XXMI libs are downloaded from GitHub
releases and deployed into `drive_c/xxmi/<IMPORTER>/`. Enabled through the
`PROTON_USE_XXMI` environment variable, which picks the right importer from
the game exe or launcher folder on its own, i.e.

```
PROTON_USE_XXMI=1 %command%
```

or through the game specific variables `PROTON_USE_EFMI`, `PROTON_USE_WWMI`,
`PROTON_USE_GIMI`, `PROTON_USE_SRMI`, `PROTON_USE_ZZMI` and `PROTON_USE_HIMI`
directly. Setting a version number instead of `1` pins the importer release,
`PROTON_XXMI_LIBS` pins the shared libs.

Mods are host-side in `$XDG_DATA_HOME/xxmi/<IMPORTER>/Mods` and symlinked
into the prefix. Direct game launches get the needed D3D11 argument appended
and the `PROTON_XXMI_*` toggles mirror the XXMI Launcher settings into
`d3dx.ini`. `PROTON_USE_GIMI_DEV=1` deploys the old GIMI v7 dev build as a
debug option for any game. Details in the README.
